# Caddyfile — automatic HTTPS in front of The Weigh Off.
#
# Replace the domain below with your No-IP hostname.
# Caddy will fetch and renew a Let's Encrypt certificate automatically,
# then reverse-proxy to the Python server on 127.0.0.1:8770.
#
# For HTTPS to work, port 443 (and 80, for the ACME challenge) must be
# forwarded through your firewall/router to this box.

yourname.ddns.net {
    encode gzip
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8770
}
